// Converts an unsigned 128-bit integer to a 32-bit IEEE 754 float
// Rounding follows the "round to nearest, ties to even" rule
// Assumptions:
//   - float is a 32-bit IEEE 754 single-precision floating-point type
//   - tu_int represents a 128-bit unsigned integer type
// Bit layout: seee eeee emmm mmmm mmmm mmmm mmmm mmmm
